  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the split peas and pick out any debris or stones.",
    "In a large pot, saute the chopped onion, carrot, and celery in a little bit of oil until they are tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the rest meat and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the split peas, chicken broth, salt, black pepper, and thyme to the pot.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 45 minutes.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the stew until it is smooth and velvety.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
